Primary upstream
----------------
freellmpool
https://github.com/0xzr/freellmpool
License: MIT (data/licenses/freellmpool-LICENSE)

Used: `data/freellmpool.providers.toml` (provider ids, base URLs, auth mode,
model ids, context sizes, key environment names and free-tier metadata) and
the design of an OpenAI-compatible routing layer over free provider routes.

The freellmpool Python runtime is not bundled or imported at runtime.

The dashboard is an original implementation.
